# Supabase
.branches
.temp

# dotenvx
# `.env` is already covered by the root .gitignore — a pattern with no slash
# matches at every depth. It is repeated here on purpose: this is where the FDC
# key lands during local `supabase functions serve`, and that protection should
# not depend on a line in a file three directories up. Not a duplicate to clean.
.env
.env.keys
.env.local
.env.*.local
